sV2.4. Non-personal information, alone, cannot be used to identify or contact you.
p22
I1
sVFun Apps and Games by SCHACH' Privacy Policy has been adopted to explain how we store and use the information collected about users online on our websites, during the usage of our products (games and apps) and/or services on mobile platforms.
p23
I1
sVWe disclose your information to third parties, that is parties other than Fun Apps and Games by SCHACH, in the following circumstances:
p24
I1
sVWhen you use any Fun Apps and Games by SCHACH' game at an SNS such as Facebook or Google +, you allow Fun Apps and Games by SCHACH to access certain information from your profile for that site.
p25
I1
sVFun Apps and Games by SCHACH collects non-personal information about your use of our online and mobile products and services both on our websites and in the course of game play and software usage.
p26
I1
sVYou can choose not to provide (when such opportunity is provided) certain information, but then you might not be able to take advantage of many of our features.
p27
I1
sVPersonal data collected within the European Union may be transferred to and stored at, a destination outside the European Union.
p28
I1
sVThe Personal Data may be freely provided by the User or collected automatically when using this Application.
p29
I1
